# Battle against Chien-Pao (the Ruinous Pokémon of the sword): the Treasures of Ruin's four-note creep, down and
# back, cut out by a saw lead over an icy celesta in B minor. Original composition for this game.
# Arranged again for the modern sound (plan 31 · MU7) on the instruments of Paldea: a string orchestra, a flamenco guitar strumming the bass's eighths and castanets clicking with it (MU6's instruments since; a wood block in the red).
title Battle! Chien-Pao
tempo 184
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.07
reverb 0.26
sound modern
room hall 1.8

